new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/slot-restrictions.md
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# Slot component restrictions
+
+Slots may declare an optional `expected` array of explicit Canvas component IDs.
+A missing or empty array leaves composition unrestricted. The active component
+policy applies to older instances as well.
+
+Slot metadata is retained in versioned component definitions and in editor
+slot nodes. Exposed-slot regions carry the policy resolved from their
+template-owned parent. Editor middleware validates the entire candidate tree
+before structural mutations enter history. Library filtering follows selection;
+hovering during a drag keeps the source mounted. Drupal applies the same rule at
+validation, auto-save, and entity save boundaries. Empty exposed-slot override
+markers remain supported.
+
+See the project's `scripts/check-slot-restrictions.php` for the authenticated
+HTTP checks and `ui/src/features/layout/exposedSlots.test.jsx` for regression
+coverage of atomic insertions, moves, and exposed-region roots.
